    "narrative": "For LawDog\u2019s lineup today, **Lawrence Butler** (73.47) and **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez** (69.84) anchor the squad, providing the highest daily efficiency scores. **Lawrence Butler** is our standout play; his favorable matchup against Dobnak (4.70 xERA) combined with a robust +17% boost for the pitcher's skill profile and a prime #4 spot makes him the engine of the offense today. Similarly, **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez** remains a locked-in must-start despite facing a decent arm in Roupp; his consistent floor and premium placement in the order continue to provide the stability we need to chase those 5x5 counting stats. **Daulton Varsho** (68.66) and **Jonathan Aranda** (69.45) also offer high-upside profiles, with **Daulton Varsho** benefiting from a generous platoon advantage against the right-handed Rodriguez, while **Jonathan Aranda** continues to capitalize on favorable SP matchups.\n\nThe most difficult bench decision involved the exclusion of **Cal Raleigh**, who posted a strong base projection but ultimately fell out of the lineup due to the lack of a confirmed active status. While his platoon profile against Gasser suggested potential for impact, the strict management of our game caps necessitates that we only deploy active, confirmed starters. We are monitoring the risk surrounding **Jung Hoo Lee** (43.28), whose score is suppressed significantly by his matchup against the elite Williams, G (2.99 xERA); despite the platoon edge, the talent of the opposing pitcher makes this a marginal play. We are holding **Bryce Harper**, **Will Smith**, and **Justin Crawford** out today as they are either inactive or dealing with injury designations, keeping our active roster focused on high-efficiency output to maintain our pursuit of league leaders. Other depth pieces like **Tyler Freeman**, **Yainer Diaz**, **Matt Chapman**, **Gleyber Torres**, **Luis Arraez**, **Masyn Winn**, **Jeremiah Jackson**, **Gavin Sheets**, **Kyle Karros**, and **Alex Freeland** will remain on the bench as we prioritize the high-score starters in today's favorable matchups.",
